= Go further with 1.4

#html.img(src: "/assets/starlog-placeholder-14.jpg", alt: "Nebulous 1.4 release artwork")

Hello, Nebulous enthusiasts! It's time to unveil the latest improvements in
our tech universe.

== New Features & Enhancements

- *NebulaSync Quantum:* A faster, smarter file syncing experience.
- *NebulaAI Odyssey:* New image, language, and automation tools.

== Bug Fixes

- Streamlined data transfer for more reliable file exchanges.
- Extended support for older devices.
- Improved error handling throughout the application.
